REGENT OF REJANG LEBONG

REGENT OF REJANG LEBONG

BENGKULU PROVINCE

REGIONAL REGULATION OF REJANG LEBONG REGENCY

NUMBER 4 OF 2015

CONCERNING

PREVENTION AND MITIGATION OF VIOLENCE

AGAINST WOMEN AND CHILDREN

BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

THE REGENT OF REJANG LEBONG,

Considering : a. that in order to guarantee the rights of women and children to participate optimally in accordance with human dignity and worth, and to receive protection from violence, discrimination and other violations of the rights of women and children, it is necessary to carry out efforts to prevent and mitigate violence against women and children.

b. that in order for efforts to prevent and mitigate violence against women and children to obtain optimal results, and to be implemented quickly, in a planned, integrated, comprehensive and organized manner by involving all relevant elements in the region, it is necessary to regulate the prevention and mitigation of violence against women and child victims of violence.

c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a and letter b, it is necessary to establish a Regional

Regulation concerning Prevention and Mitigation of

Violence Against Women and Children.

In View of : 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;

2. Law Number 28 of 1959 concerning the Establishment of Emergency Law Number 4 of 1956 (State Gazette

of 1956 Number 55), Emergency Law

Number 5 of 1956 (State Gazette of 1956

Number 56) and Emergency Law Number 6 of 1956 (State Gazette of 1956 Number 57) concerning the Establishment of Level II Regions Including Municipalities, Within the Level I Region of South Sumatra, as Law (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1959 Number 73, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1821);

3. Law Number 9 of 1967 concerning the Establishment of Bengkulu Province (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1967 Number 19, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 2828);

4. Law Number 4 of 1979 concerning Child Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1979 Number 32, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3143);

5. Law Number 7 of 1984 concerning Ratification of the Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1984 Number 29, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3277);

6. Law Number 5 of 1998 concerning Ratification of the Convention Against Torture and Other Cruel, Inhuman or Degrading Treatment or Punishment (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1998 Number 164, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3783);

7. Law Number 39 of 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);

8. Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection as amended by Law Number 35 of 2014 (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2014 Number 297, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5606);

9. Law Number 23 of 2004 concerning the Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);

10. Law Number 13 of 2006 concerning Protection of Witnesses and Victims (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2006 Number 64, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4635);

11. Law Number 21 of 2007 concerning the Eradication of the Criminal Act of Trafficking in Persons (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2007 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4720);

12. Law Number 36 of 2009 concerning Health (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2009 Number 99, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3495);

13. Law Number 12 of 2011 concerning the Formulation of Legislation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2011 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5234);

14. Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government as amended several times most recently by Law Number 9 of 2015 (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2015

Number 2016, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 58);

